{"page":504,"width":1746,"height":2635,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"12.4 커널 입출력 서브시스멤","words":[{"text":"12.4","x":1076,"y":161,"width":70,"height":22},{"text":"커널","x":1164,"y":160,"width":42,"height":26},{"text":"입출력","x":1217,"y":160,"width":68,"height":26},{"text":"서브시스멤","x":1295,"y":160,"width":115,"height":26}]},{"text":"565","words":[{"text":"565","x":1483,"y":158,"width":58,"height":28}]},{"text":"다. 우% 프로그램이 wakelock을 보유하고 있는 동안 커널은 시스템이 전원 축소로 진","words":[{"text":"다.","x":294,"y":288,"width":37,"height":37},{"text":"우%","x":347,"y":288,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"프로그램이","x":427,"y":288,"width":154,"height":37},{"text":"wakelock을","x":597,"y":288,"width":175,"height":36},{"text":"보유하고","x":785,"y":288,"width":119,"height":37},{"text":"있는","x":919,"y":288,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"동안","x":992,"y":289,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"커널은","x":1070,"y":289,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"시스템이","x":1176,"y":289,"width":125,"height":38},{"text":"전원","x":1320,"y":289,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"축소로","x":1396,"y":289,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"진","x":1510,"y":291,"width":29,"height":36}]},{"text":"입하는 것을 막는다. 예를 들어, Android Market이 -용공 프로그램을 업데이트하는 동","words":[{"text":"입하는","x":294,"y":349,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"것을","x":406,"y":350,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"막는다.","x":483,"y":350,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"예를","x":599,"y":349,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"들어,","x":669,"y":349,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"Android","x":749,"y":352,"width":127,"height":30},{"text":"Market이","x":890,"y":349,"width":142,"height":37},{"text":"-용공","x":1048,"y":350,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"프로그램을","x":1124,"y":350,"width":162,"height":37},{"text":"업데이트하는","x":1300,"y":351,"width":194,"height":36},{"text":"동","x":1506,"y":353,"width":34,"height":35}]},{"text":"안, 업데이트가 완료될 때까지 시스템이 슬립 모드로 전환되지 않도록 wakelock을 유","words":[{"text":"안,","x":294,"y":411,"width":40,"height":37},{"text":"업데이트가","x":352,"y":411,"width":162,"height":